<title>JAPAN: Tigers Polymer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tigers Polymer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.77		vs	    7.97</p>
<p> Operating	  650    million	  vs	  308    million</p>
<p> Current	    638    million	  vs	  317    million</p>
<p> Net		  353    million	  vs	  154    million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.61 yen	  vs	   10.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tigers Polymer Corp is a leading producer of rubber and resin hoses.</p>
</text>
